cron.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2d71GZva7bNK5BUZuyJnwXnQGC5Q 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Flogos%2Fcustomers%2Fholocron.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2d71GZva7bNK5BUZuyJnwXnQGC5Q 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Flogos%2Fcustomers%2Fholocron.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2d71GZva7bNK5BUZuyJnwXnQGC5Q"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-ui-border animate-line-draw"></div></div></section><section class="border-b border-[#F0F0F2]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1400px] overflow-x-clip px-6 pb-16 lg:pb-20"><div class="mb-12"><p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-5 text-web-primary-500">Products &amp; services</p><h2 class="text-heading-md lg:text-heading-mdp font-semibold text-web-secondary-500">Own what you want, hand off the rest</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2"><section class="core-card !my-0 flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-ui-border bg-white" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(44px)"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-7"><div class="mb-5"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-web-primary-50 text-web-primary-500 size-12"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap size-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15.914 4a1.5 1.5 0 00-2.474-1.561l-9 9A1.5 1.5 0 005.5 14h4.002a.5.5 0 01.471.666L8.086 20a1.5 1.5 0 002.475 1.56l9-9A1.5 1.5 0 0018.5 10h-3.997a.5.5 0 01-.472-.667z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1"><span class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-web-primary-500">Zyte API</span><span class="text-[15px] font-medium text-text-300">Web scraping API</span></div><h3 class="mt-2 text-balance text-[24px] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-web-secondary-500 lg:text-[26px]">One API across easy, moderate and hard websites. Skip managing bans, proxies and browsers.</h3><p class="flex-1 pt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty text-text-400 lg:text-lg">Point it at a URL. Zyte API picks the leanest access strategy that works and escalates only when the website demands it. You&#x27;re billed on success.</p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3"><a class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-semibold no-underline transition-colors cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none rounded-lg border-2 border-transparent px-4 py-1.5 text-base bg-accent text-white hover:bg-accent-hover focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent" href="https://app.zyte.com/account/signup/zyteapi">Get started with Zyte API</a><a class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-semibold transition-colors cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none py-1.5 text-base px-0 text-accent no-underline focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent" href="/zyte-api/"><span class="relative after:absolute after:bottom-[-2px] after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-current after:transition-[width] after:duration-300 after:ease-out group-hover:after:w-full">Explore Zyte API</span><span class="inline-flex translate-y-[2px] items-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-[3px]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class="core-card !my-0 flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-ui-border bg-white" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(44px)"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-7"><div class="mb-5"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-web-primary-50 text-web-primary-500 size-12"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-database size-6" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5"></path><path d="M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1"><span class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-web-primary-500">Zyte Data</span><span class="text-[15px] font-medium text-text-300">Managed web data service</span></div><h3 class="mt-2 text-balance text-[24px] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-web-secondary-500 lg:text-[26px]">Hand it over. Get clean data delivered.</h3><p class="flex-1 pt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-pretty text-text-400 lg:text-lg">A managed web data service. Our team builds, runs and maintains the collection, delivering deduplicated, schema-ready data to your warehouse on the cadence you set. Nothing to build, nothing to maintain.</p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3"><button type="button" class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-semibold no-underline transition-colors cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none rounded-lg border-2 border-transparent px-4 py-1.5 text-base bg-accent text-white hover:bg-accent-hover focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">Talk to us</button><a class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-semibold transition-colors cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none py-1.5 text-base px-0 text-accent no-underline focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent" href="/data-extraction/"><span class="relative after:absolute after:bottom-[-2px] after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-current after:transition-[width] after:duration-300 after:ease-out group-hover:after:w-full">Explore Zyte Data</span><span class="inline-flex translate-y-[2px] items-center transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-[3px]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section></div><div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><section class="core-card !my-0 flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-ui-border bg-white" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(44px)"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-7"><div class="mb-4"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-web-primary-50 text-web-primary-500 size-10 rounded-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cloud size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1"><span class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-web-primary-500">Scrapy Cloud</span><span class="text-[15px] font-medium text-text-300">Scalable cloud hosting</span></div><h3 class="mt-2 flex-1 text-balance text-xl font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-web-secondary-500">Run and scale crawlers without owning servers.</h3><div class="mt-7"><a class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-semibold transition-colors cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none py-1.5 text-base px-0 text-accent no-underline focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent" href="/scrapy-cloud/"><span class="relative after:absolute after:bottom-[-2px] after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-current after:transition-[width] after:d