enter gap-2 font-semibold no-underline transition-colors cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none rounded-lg border-2 border-transparent px-4 py-1.5 text-base bg-accent text-white hover:bg-accent-hover focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent shrink-0" href="https://app.zyte.com/account/signup/zyteapi">Run your first request</a></div><div class="hidden md:block rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0B102E] shadow-[0_32px_64px_-24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] overflow-hidden mb-12"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1fr_1fr] divide-y divide-white/10 lg:divide-x lg:divide-y-0"><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-3 shrink-0"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/45">Customize</span></div><div class="flex flex-col px-5 py-2"><div role="radiogroup" aria-label="Fetch mode"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-between gap-3 w-full text-left"><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/55">Raw HTTP response body</span><span class="flex h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-brandAccentSecondaryCold-500 bg-brandAccentSecondaryCold-500"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white"></span></span></button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-between gap-3 w-full text-left"><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/55">Browser rendering</span><span class="flex h-[18px] w-[18px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors border-white/20 bg-white/5"></span></button></div><div class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-between gap-3"><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/55 min-w-0">Structured extraction</span><div class="shrink-0"><button type="button" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false"