ily.</p><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brandAccentSecondaryCold-200 no-underline transition-all hover:gap-3" href="https://www.zyte.com/join-community/">zyte.com/join-community/<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="border-b border-[#F0F0F2] pb-[4.5rem]"><section class="bg-text-50"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl lg:max-w-7xl px-4"><div class="mb-12 max-w-[760px]"><span class="inline-block mb-5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[1.6px] uppercase text-accent">Don&#x27;t take our word for it</span><h2 class="text-heading-md md:text-heading-mdp font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-1.6px] text-text-600">Reviews</h2></div><div class="relative"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-0 z-10 w-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-text-50 to-transparent hidden md:block"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 right-0 z-10 w-10 bg-gradient-to-l from-text-50 to-transparent hidden md:block"></div><div class="overflow-hidden px-4 md:px-10 touch-pan-y select-none" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Reviews"><div class="flex transition-transform duration-[600ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]" style="transform:translateX(-0%)"><div class="shrink-0 px-2.5" style="width:100%" aria-hidden="false"><div class="flex flex-col h-full rounded-2xl border border-ui-border bg-white p-7 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-accent"><div style="visibility:visible"><div role="img" class="flex items-center gap-1" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="text-warning-500" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="_R_8n